%% WiFi Test Orchestrator architecture baseline 0.1.0
sequenceDiagram
    participant R as Plugin Registry
    participant A as Agent
    participant T as Local trust store
    participant P as Plugin Runtime

    R-->>A: Authorized manifest and plugin artifact reference
    A->>A: Verify allowlist and expected hash
    A->>T: Verify signer trust and revocation state
    T-->>A: Trust decision
    A->>A: Verify Plugin API compatibility and capabilities
    A->>P: Activate only registered operations
    P-->>A: Provider metadata and execution result

    R-->>A: Revocation update
    A->>T: Refresh revocation state
    A->>P: Prevent new executions for revoked plugin
